id: close-range-illusions
name: Close Range Illusions
restriction: true
reduction: 4
# "You must select yourself for the Target Square of this Unique Ability's AoE" - said where who is inside is asked.
illusionOnSelf: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Illusion's Sphere is centred on you.
text: >
  Close Range Illusions: You can only create convincing illusions if they remain close to you.
  –Locked Advancements: N/A
  –TP Cost: -4
  –Effect: You must select yourself for the Target Square of this Unique Ability’s AoE.
